<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_900_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240610__20240610_zoKoLDBq73Ij"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-06-10" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

